    old "In the twilight hours of yestereve, the City of Karkyr had the distinct pleasure of witnessing a splendid matrimonial union between the esteemed scions of two venerable families: the Mitsuhide from the distant West and the esteemed Kouchi from our very own Karkyr.\n\nThe bride, Lady Sui Kouchi, graced the occasion in a resplendent midnight blue kimono, a testament to the finest craftsmanship."
