    new "自由思想者联盟怎么可能群龙无首呢？肯定有人在幕后操纵着他们。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2040
    old "I'm offended that some of those upstarts at the League of Freethinkers are getting so rich, when so many of our own true blue-blooded nobles are facing ruin."
    new "我感到愤慨的是，自由思想家联盟中的一些暴发户变得如此富有，而我们自己的许多真正的蓝血贵族却面临破产。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2041
    old "The League of Freethinkers is shunned by many of the nobles and courtiers because it takes commoners in, but they have started some of the most profitable enterprises in the city."
    new "自由思想者联盟因接纳平民而受到许多贵族和朝臣的排斥，但他们却在城里创办了一些最赚钱的企业。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2042
    old "Ever heard of the Brotherhood? They say they'll defend the common people against the nobles and high-borns. Such nonsense."
    new "听说过兄弟会吗？他们说要保护平民百姓免受贵族和上流人士的欺压。真是胡说八道。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2043
    old "I've heard of a secret political organization called the Brotherhood. I have no idea who they are or what they do, but they're rumored to have enormous power in the city."
    new "我听说过一个名为“兄弟会”的秘密政治组织。我不知道他们是谁，也不知道他们做什么，但据说他们在城里拥有巨大的权力。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2044
    old "Some crazy jerk got my friend all worked up about 'sticking it to the royals', and 'taking back what's rightfully ours'. I begged my friend not to listen to such drivel, but now she's been arrested by the king's guard, and they suspect me as well..."
    new "有个疯子煽动我朋友，说什么要“反抗皇室”、“夺回属于我们的东西”。我苦苦哀求她别听信这种胡言乱语，结果她现在被国王的卫兵逮捕了，而且他们还怀疑我……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2045
    old "Brother, you should not toil and suffer so that a few high-born loafers can hold banquets and orgies all day and all night. If you joined the Brotherhood, you could put an end to this... But hush, someone's coming."
    new "兄弟，你辛勤劳作、饱受苦难，不应该让几个出身高贵的游手好闲之徒日夜宴饮狂欢。如果你加入兄弟会，就能阻止这一切……嘘，有人来了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2046
    old "This woman claimed the Brotherhood will rise to help the little people. But I know the truth of it: within a few months, they'd put themselves and their relatives in all the powerful positions, and they'd be no better than King Pharo."
    new "这个女人声称兄弟会将会崛起，帮助小人物。但我知道真相：不出几个月，他们就会把自己和亲戚安插到所有权力位置上，他们和法老王没什么两样。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2047
    old "King Pharo is our rightful leader chosen by the gods themselves. It is heresy to question the place of our betters: let us talk no more of that so-called 'Brotherhood'."
    new "法老王是我们由神明亲自选定的合法领袖。质疑我们先辈的地位是异端邪说：我们不要再谈论所谓的“兄弟会”了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2048
    old "Magicians are vermin who deserve nothing but ruin. They spoil our beloved city with their godless experiments. I wish the King had enough sense to make them all hang."
    new "巫师是些害虫，他们只配得到毁灭。他们用那些亵渎神明的实验毁了我们挚爱的城市。我真希望国王有足够的智慧，把他们都绞死。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2049
    old "What's wrong with a little magic? It's not perversion, or a scam. People are afraid of things they don't understand, that's all. I dabble in magic myself, did you know? Here's an ointment you could buy for cheap..."
    new "玩玩魔法有什么错？它既不是变态，也不是骗局。人们只是害怕自己不了解的事物而已。你知道吗？我自己也略懂魔法。给你推荐一种便宜的药膏……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2050
    old "Magicians have long been established in Zan without too much trouble. But their conflict with the church of Arios is starting to pull at the seams."
    new "魔法师在赞恩大陆早已安家落户，鲜少遇到麻烦。但他们与阿里奥斯教会之间的冲突却开始激化。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2051
    old "A priest of Arios himself told me that wizards consort with demons and plot Zan's ruin. Something must be done."
    new "阿瑞俄斯的一位祭司亲口告诉我，巫师们与恶魔勾结，密谋毁灭赞恩。必须采取行动了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2052
    old "Those magicians are just rich, spoiled brats toying with forces they don't understand. I don't like those bigots from the Cathedra, but they have a point."
    new "那些魔法师不过是些有钱又被宠坏的纨绔子弟，玩弄着他们根本不了解的力量。我不喜欢教廷里的那些偏执狂，但他们说的也有道理。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2053
    old "Heresy of not, the mages are contributing good money to our city's finances. If every questionable practice was banned in this city, there wouldn't be much left of Zan."
    new "不管这算不算异端邪说，法师们确实为我们城市的财政做出了可观的贡献。如果这座城市禁止所有可疑的做法，赞城恐怕早已不复存在了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2054
    old "Monsters have been spotted in Zan. I myself saw a three-headed wolf raping a young girl in a dark alley. What has this city come to?"
    new "赞城里出现了怪物。我亲眼看到一头三头狼在黑暗的小巷里强奸一个年轻女孩。这座城市究竟变成了什么样子？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2055
    old "Sorcerers are responsible for the monsters plague in this city, who else? They should throw the lot of them in a dark cell with their pets, and throw away the key."
    new "这座城市的怪物肆虐，罪魁祸首就是巫师，还能有谁？应该把他们全都关进黑暗的牢房，连同他们的宠物一起扔掉，然后把钥匙扔掉。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2056
    old "I don't buy it. Wizards have enough trouble as it is with the Light priests. Why would they release monsters in the streets and make their situation worse?"
    new "我不相信。巫师们已经够受光明祭司的困扰了，他们为什么要放出怪物到街上，让自己的处境雪上加霜呢？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2057
    old "Monsters roam the streets at night. No one should stay out late these days, especially young, beautiful girls."
    new "夜里，妖魔鬼怪在街头游荡。如今谁都不应该在外待到很晚，尤其是年轻漂亮的女孩子。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2058
    old "An entire patrol wiped out near the Gardens? This monster problem is getting out of hand!"
    new "一整个巡逻队在花园附近全军覆没？这怪物问题越来越严重了！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2059
    old "The Cathedra is a nice enough looking building from outside, but you wouldn't like what goes on inside, believe me."
    new "从外面看，大教堂是一座相当漂亮的建筑，但相信我，你不会喜欢里面发生的事情。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2060
    old "The High Priestess has advocated for the complete removal of magic from the city. She'll have her way; she always does."
    new "大祭司主张彻底清除城中的魔法。她一定会如愿以偿；她总是如此。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2061
    old "I remember the times before the war, when the Grandmaster was heading the Arios cult... These were gentler days, I tell you."
    new "我记得战争爆发前，大宗师领导着阿瑞俄斯教派的时候……我告诉你，那是一个更温和的时代。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2062
    old "Ever since the Grandmaster left for the Holy war, the High Priestess has been consolidating her power in the city. I don't think she wants him to come back."
    new "自从大宗师前往圣战以来，女祭司一直在巩固她在城中的权力。我认为她不希望他回来。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2063
    old "Heard any news from the war in the Holy lands? They told me it's not going well. The heretics are resisting us at every step, but surely Arios won't let his flock down."
    new "你听到圣地战事的消息了吗？他们告诉我情况不太乐观。异教徒处处阻挠我们，但阿里奥斯肯定不会让他的信众失望的。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2064
    old "The Arios priests want to impose their cult on the rest of the city, plain and simple. Don't be fooled by the bitch priestesses' righteous sermons."
    new "阿瑞俄斯祭司们想把他们的教派强加给城里的其他人，就这么简单。别被那些泼妇祭司们义正言辞的布道给骗了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2065
    old "A friend of mine became a nun of Arios, but she had a change of heart and ran away a week ago. I don't know what happened."
    new "我的一个朋友成了阿里奥斯修道院的修女，但她一周前改变了主意，逃走了。我不知道发生了什么事。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2066
    old "I can't stand those upright do-gooders from the Arios church. I'm sure they're hiding something."
    new "我受不了阿里奥斯教会那些自以为是的伪善者。我确信他们肯定藏着什么秘密。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2067
    old "They say a lot of Arios priestesses used to be hookers, before they converted. I don't know why. But it's kind of turning me on."
    new "据说很多阿瑞俄斯女祭司在皈依之前都是妓女。我不知道为什么。但这有点让我兴奋。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2068
    old "Arios is the god of Light and Strength. May His Light guide us towards good deeds, and His Strength support our arms when the time comes to strike down evil."
    new "阿瑞俄斯是光明与力量之神。愿他的光明指引我们行善，愿他的力量在我们战胜邪恶之时支撑我们的双臂。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2069
    old "The true teachings of Arios are a thing of beauty. Don't listen to those priests, all they know how to do is spout nonsense. Find the Light of Arios within your heart."
    new "阿瑞俄斯的真正教义是美好的。不要听那些祭司的，他们只会胡说八道。在你的心中寻找阿瑞俄斯之光。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2070
    old "They say demons roam the streets. I say it's nothing compared to what goes on at Court."
    new "他们说街头有恶魔游荡。我说，与法庭上发生的事情相比，这根本不算什么。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2071
    old "All the court nobles do is eat, drink, fuck, and plot against one another. I wish I had that kind of life."
    new "宫廷贵族们除了吃喝玩乐，就是互相算计。我真希望自己也能过那样的生活。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2072
    old "This city is doomed. When the head is rotten, how can you save the body?"
    new "这座城市完了。头腐烂了，身体怎么救得了？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2073
    old "My sister is a maid at court. She had a glimpse of one of the ceremonies and wouldn't shut up about it. 'The dresses!', 'The lights!', 'The jewels!', 'The gold dishes!', and so on."
    new "我妹妹是宫廷女仆。她瞥见了一场仪式，就一直喋喋不休地说：“那些礼服！”、“那些灯光！”、“那些珠宝！”、“那些金盘子！”等等。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2074
    old "Every noble courtier has one or more courtesans in tow. That's how they call hookers there. Not that it stops them from visiting regular brothels, mind you."
    new "每个贵族廷臣身边都带着一个或多个侍女。在他们那里，妓女就是这么称呼的。不过，这并不妨碍他们光顾正规的妓院。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2075
    old "The nobles of Zan are a curious breed. They suck their estates dry trying to make it at court and impress the King, but they all despise him and think him weak. They are the ones being played for fools."
    new "赞恩的贵族们是一群奇特的家伙。他们榨干自己的家产，试图在朝廷中出人头地，博取国王的欢心，但他们却都鄙视国王，认为他软弱无能。他们才是被愚弄的傻瓜。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2076
    old "At the beginning of his reign, 18 years ago, King Pharo was doing well enough. But his achievements have been unraveling one by one, and now the city has lost all direction."
    new "十八年前，法老王登基之初，政绩斐然。但他的成就却逐渐瓦解，如今这座城市已迷失了方向。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2077
    old "I don't care what happened to the princess's mother, the King should have remarried. What if something happens to the princess?"
    new "我不在乎公主的母亲发生了什么事，国王应该再婚。万一公主出了什么事怎么办？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2078
    old "No male heir spells disaster for any royal family. Why doesn't the King understand that?"
    new "没有男性继承人对任何王室来说都是灾难。国王为什么不明白这一点呢？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2079
    old "Because King Pharo has no male heir, power will go to the princess's son, when and if she marries. I guess she would be regent in the interim."
    new "由于法老王没有男性继承人，王位将传给公主的儿子，前提是她将来再嫁。我猜在此期间她会担任摄政王。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2080
    old "Sure, King Pharo has a laissez-faire attitude to everything... But isn't that what makes Zan so great? Would you like to see a crackdown on whores, alcohol, spices, or even gambling?"
    new "没错，法老王对一切都采取放任自流的态度……但这不正是赞恩王国如此伟大的原因吗？你想看到政府严厉打击妓女、酒精、香料，甚至是赌博吗？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2081
    old "The King is always brooding, his mood dark... He sure looks grim for someone whose courtiers throw so many parties."
    new "国王总是闷闷不乐，心情阴沉……对于一个经常举办宴会的朝臣来说，他看起来确实很严肃。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2082
    old "The princess is a lovely thing, isn't she? All the knights and nobles are crazy in love with her."
    new "这位公主真是个可爱的人儿，不是吗？所有的骑士和贵族都为她疯狂。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2083
    old "Her delicate features and manners make the princess the sweetheart of all Zan, nobles and commoners alike."
    new "她精致的容貌和举止使公主成为所有赞国贵族和平民的宠儿。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2084
    old "The princess seems in a dark mood sometimes. Could such a blessed person have problems like all of us?"
    new "公主有时似乎情绪低落。像她这样幸福的人，也会像我们普通人一样遇到烦恼吗？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2085
    old "The King's knights are all sworn to protect him and his family. Their commander looks like Arios made flesh himself. He's a very zealous and devoted man."
    new "国王的骑士们都宣誓效忠国王和他的家人。他们的指挥官看起来就像是阿里奥斯化身为人。他是一位非常虔诚和忠诚的人。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2086
    old "I hear some big shot's been murdered a few days back in the castle. They are trying to keep the lid on it, but it seems like trouble is brewing."
    new "我听说几天前城堡里有个大人物被谋杀了。他们试图掩盖这件事，但似乎麻烦要来了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2087
    old "Some ancient weapons hold tremendous power. I wonder how one can get a hold on one of those?"
    new "有些古代兵器蕴含着巨大的威力。我想知道怎样才能得到其中一件？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2088
    old "When people go to a whorehouse, they expect more than just a tryst... Good service is always appreciated."
    new "人们去妓院，不只是想寻欢作乐……良好的服务总是会受到赞赏。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2089
    old "So many young girls are turning into whoring slaves these days... Some even turn themselves in voluntarily. I guess it's one way to get food and shelter in these troubled times."
    new "如今这么多年轻女孩沦为卖淫奴隶……有些甚至是自愿的。我想，在如今这动荡的时代，这或许是她们获得食物和住所的一种途径吧。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2090
    old "The girls are so glamorous there... I never knew being a slut was so rewarding. Makes me question my morals!"
    new "那里的女孩们真是太迷人了……我以前从不知道当荡妇这么爽。这让我开始怀疑自己的道德观了！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2091
    old "All travelers agree on one thing: the best thing about Zan is its sex slaves... Any kind of sexual fantasy can be fulfilled here. Many slaves take great pride in fulfilling their master's desires."
    new "所有旅行者都一致认为：赞岛最棒的地方在于它的性奴……任何性幻想都能在这里得到满足。许多奴隶都以满足主人的欲望为荣。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2092
    old "Girls in Zan are so easy. All it takes is showing up at the same place every day, chatting them up, and sooner or later they'll roll in the hay with you."
    new "赞恩的女孩太容易搞定了。你只需要每天去同一个地方，和她们搭讪，迟早她们就会和你上床。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2093
    old "That merchant girl is so hot, man! I'd go there and buy stuff every day if I could convince her to fool around with me."
    new "那个卖东西的姑娘真漂亮！如果我能说服她跟我玩玩，我愿意天天去她那儿买东西。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2094
    old "People who like unusual sex acts are less common, but they pay more money."
    new "喜欢不寻常性行为的人比较少见，但他们愿意花更多的钱。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2095
    old "I came by this brothel the other day, and saw a pink-haired hottie... but was disappointed to find out she wasn't one of the working staff."
    new "前几天我路过这家妓院，看到一个粉色头发的美女……但很失望地发现她不是这里的工作人员。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2096
    old "After a day's hard work, what's hotter than going to a club to be served by beautiful girls, then have one of them strip and go down on you? I understand the appeal."
    new "辛苦工作一天之后，还有什么比去夜总会享受美女服务，然后让其中一个脱光衣服为你口交更让人兴奋的呢？我理解这种吸引力。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2097
    old "Whores are like priestesses for the sex goddess, that's what my 'pa used to say. He was usually drunk as a skunk."
    new "我爸以前常说，妓女就像性爱女神的女祭司。他通常都喝得烂醉。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2098
    old "Some guy from Westmarch had trouble understanding what geishas are. He kept saying they're like regular hookers. I swear, it's impossible to educate these unrefined barbarians ."
    new "有个来自西境的家伙搞不懂艺伎是什么。他一直说她们跟普通妓女一样。我发誓，这些没教养的野蛮人真是没法教育。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2099
    old "I went to this little establishment by the harbor, asking for a good massage. And I really got a good one, down there... Isn't it wonderful?"
    new "我去了港口边一家小店，想做个按摩。结果按摩效果真的很好……是不是很棒？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2104
    old "Have you seen the new Guard uniforms? They adorn their armor with fine silk, while the rest of us starve..., "
    new "你见过卫兵的新制服吗？他们用精美的丝绸装饰盔甲，而我们其他人却在挨饿……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2105
    old "I've heard some talk of a secret lair somewhere around the Slums... A haven for thieves and bandits. I shiver to think of it."
    new "我听说贫民窟附近有个秘密巢穴……那是盗贼和强盗的避风港。一想到就让我不寒而栗。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2106
    old "Captain Farah is one greedy bitch. Her men came yesterday to shake one of my friends down. Everyone hates her, but they say she's got protection in high places."
    new "法拉船长真是个贪婪的贱人。她的人昨天来敲诈我一个朋友。人人都恨她，但据说她有高层庇护。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2107
    old "The head of the guards is Captain Farah. Best stay clear of them if you want my advice. Levies and taxes are all the guards care about. If you ask me, they just make them up as they go."
    new "卫兵的头目是法拉队长。听我的劝告，最好离他们远点。卫兵们眼里只有征税和赋税。依我看，他们都是随随便便定的。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2108
    old "Some say the captain of the Guard is getting too greedy, even among her own men... There are some who say they'd do better. Maybe they mean they'd be better at not getting caught."
    new "有人说卫队长太贪婪了，连她自己的部下都如此……有些人说他们做得更好。也许他们的意思是，他们更擅长不被抓。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2109
    old "Thieves are getting bold these days. Or desperate. Doesn't look like the guards care to do anything about it, mind you."
    new "最近盗贼们越来越大胆了。或许是走投无路了。不过，看起来守卫们对此并不在意。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2110
    old "My neighbor complained about the taxes, so they took him in, and no one's heard of him since. Better suck it up and stay alive, if you want my 2 denars."
    new "我的邻居抱怨税收，结果被抓了起来，从此就没人听到他的消息了。如果你想要我的2第纳尔，最好忍着点，好好活着。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2111
    old "The guards took everything from me, but what can I do? Only the King has higher authority, and he won't listen to a commoner."
    new "卫兵们夺走了我的一切，但我又能怎么办呢？只有国王才有更高的权力，但他不会听一个平民的话。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2112
    old "Some say the thieves operate in an organized fashion, much like a guild. I don't buy this nonsense. Ever seen a thief with anything else than spice for brains?"
    new "有人说这些盗贼组织严密，就像一个行会。我不信这种鬼话。你见过哪个盗贼脑子里除了香料以外还有别的东西吗？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2113
    old "People here like to blame a secret Shalia cabal for all their ills, but let me tell you: it's our good Arios-loving captain who's robbing us blind at the moment!"
    new "这里的人喜欢把他们所有的不幸都归咎于一个秘密的沙利亚阴谋集团，但让我告诉你：是我们的善良的、热爱阿瑞俄斯的船长现在正在疯狂地掠夺我们！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2114
    old "I keep hearing about this new brothel outside the city. I really have to check it out."
    new "我一直听说城外新开了一家妓院。我真得去看看。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2117
    old "There has been a wave of murders in the city lately... And not just the usual rabble: they took out some pretty big shots."
    new "最近城里发生了一连串谋杀案……而且受害者不只是普通的流氓：他们干掉了一些相当有影响力的人物。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2118
    old "People say the streets aren't safe at night, hired blades on the prowl... Many highborns won't go out anymore without an escort."
    new "人们说，夜里街道不安全，雇佣的刀客四处游荡……许多贵族子弟现在出门都得有人护送。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2119
    old "Somebody's been snuffing out the blue bloods one by one... It was about time someone started fighting for justice in this city!"
    new "有人一直在逐一铲除贵族阶层……是时候有人开始在这个城市里为正义而战了！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2120
    old "A murderous killer is on the prowl... Some say he killed the high judge, and the royals could be next."
    new "一名凶残的杀手正在四处游荡……有人说他杀死了高级法官，皇室成员可能是下一个目标。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2121
    old "How dare someone threaten the life of our dear Princess? I hope they catch the motherfucker, and gouge his eyes out!"
    new "怎么会有人威胁我们亲爱的公主的生命？我希望他们抓住那个混蛋，挖出他的眼睛！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2122
    old "No one is safe in this city, not even the judges... Time to head for the country until things quiet down."
    new "在这座城市里，没有人是安全的，就连法官也不例外……是时候前往乡下，直到局势平静下来。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2123
    old "Don't worry about those killers. There are only after the bigwigs, no one is paying to assassinate small fry like you and me."
    new "别担心那些杀手。他们只追杀大人物，没人会花钱去暗杀像你我这样的小人物。"

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2124
    old "I've heard of a fearsome group of superhuman stealth warriors, on a quest for blood and revenge throughout the city... They call them {i}ninjas{/i}."
    new "I've heard of a fearsome group of superhuman stealth warriors, on a quest for blood and revenge throughout the city... They call them {i}ninjas{/i}."

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2125
    old "Ninjas? What a load of bull. They only exist in children's tales."
    new "忍者？简直胡扯。他们只存在于儿童故事里。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2126
    old "Ninjas are a secret society of bloodthirsty assassins that has infiltrated Zan. Or so I hear."
    new "我听说，忍者是一个嗜血成性的秘密刺客组织，已经渗透到赞城。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2127
    old "Why would anyone threaten the Princess's life? She's the only one who doesn't wish us little people ill in this royal nest of vipers."
    new "为什么会有人威胁公主的生命？在这个蛇蝎成性的皇室巢穴里，只有她不希望我们这些小人物遭遇不幸。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2128
    old "Noble families have paid a heavy toll in the latest wave of murders... Maybe this so-called revolution is coming after all?"
    new "在最近这波谋杀浪潮中，贵族家庭付出了沉重的代价……也许这场所谓的革命终究还是要来了？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2131
    old "You won't believe what I saw the other day! A young woman was leaping across roofs, like one of these daredevil ninjas! And after her went a complete lunatic drooling like a maniac, wielding a toy hamer! I swear, sex games are getting out of hand in this city..."
    new "你绝对想不到我前几天看到了什么！一个年轻女子像个亡命忍者一样在屋顶上飞来飞去！紧接着，一个疯子像个疯子一样流着口水，挥舞着一把玩具锤子！我发誓，这座城市的性游戏越来越离谱了……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2132
    old "There she was, a super cute girl with blue hair and a stunning pair of knockers. I was so distracted by them, I didn't realize she was stealing all the fish until she left in a puff of smoke, saying 'Meow'!"
    new "她就在那里，一个超级可爱的女孩，有着蓝色的头发和一对令人惊艳的胸部。我完全被它们吸引住了，直到她化作一团烟雾消失，还叫了一声“喵！”，我才意识到她正在偷走所有的鱼。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2133
    old "Have you heard about the archmage that is the active Dean of the Magic University? A real piece of work, let me tell you."
    new "你听说过那位现任魔法大学院长的大魔法师吗？我跟你说，他可真是个难缠的人物。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2134
    old "I have no talent for magic, but I was told I could enroll at Magic University for the right price. The clerk there truly doesn't give a fuck."
    new "我没有魔法天赋，但有人告诉我，只要付得起钱，我就可以入读魔法大学。那里的办事员根本不在乎。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2135
    old "I heard there's a vengeful ninja ghost roaming the city, assaulting private citizens and even sometimes giving them surprise handjobs! Don't laugh! You could be next!!!"
    new "我听说城里有个复仇心切的忍者幽灵游荡，袭击平民百姓，有时甚至还会给他们来个“惊喜”手活！别笑！下一个可能就是你！！！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2136
    old "... I tell you, I had to duck out of the way or I would have crushed by a damn earthquake. It was summoned by a devil ninja with a yellow outfit! *make the Arios sign* Sun God protects!"
    new "……我跟你说，我当时赶紧躲开，不然就被该死的地震压死了。那地震是一个穿着黄色衣服的恶魔忍者召唤出来的！*做出阿瑞俄斯之手*太阳神保佑！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2137
    old "So he saw that schoolgirl the other day, cute little one, heading for Magic U. He just wanted to cop a feel, you know, brush her ass a little, nothing serious. Damn, man, the poor sod is still at the Arios hospitium! She stabbed him real good. Kids these days!"
    new "前几天他看到那个女学生，可爱的小家伙，正要去魔法大学。他只是想摸摸她的屁股，你知道，轻轻碰一下，没什么大不了的。哎，可怜的家伙，现在还在阿瑞俄斯医院呢！她狠狠地捅了他一刀。现在的孩子啊！"

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2138
    old "The Princess {i}has{/i} to marry soon, before the nobles start a damned civil war, shades of Shalia! Some of them are already building private armies. this can't end well..."
    new "The Princess {i}has{/i} to marry soon, before the nobles start a damned civil war, shades of Shalia! Some of them are already building private armies. this can't end well..."

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2139
    old "Have you heard? The King is sick. If he croaks, the nobles will be at each other's throat, and Princess Kurohime is only a woman. What can she do?"
    new "你听说了吗？国王病了。如果他驾崩，贵族们必将反目成仇，而黑姬公主只是个女子，她又能怎么办呢？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2140
    old "So she turned the student into a wererat, and now he haunts the sewers at night, wishing he had paid attention in class. Don't you ask again about studying magic!"
    new "于是她把那个学生变成了狼鼠，现在他每晚都在下水道里游荡，后悔当初上课没好好听讲。你以后别再问她学魔法的事了！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2141
    old "Ever heard of Stee V the Wondrous, the best bard in all of Xeros? Too bad about his eyes, though. I guess that way he can hear the music better."
    new "你听说过神奇的斯蒂·V吗？他是泽罗斯大陆上最棒的吟游诗人。可惜他的眼睛不好。不过我想，这样他就能更好地聆听音乐了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2142
    old "Some people claim the Avatar of Arios appears to them when the going get tough. I think the problem is not with their going, but with their drinking."
    new "有些人声称，当他们遇到困难时，阿里奥斯的化身就会显现。我认为问题不在于他们遇到的困难，而在于他们酗酒。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2143
    old "There's an up-and-coming brothel you should know about: [brothel.name]. You really should drop by there. Some of these girls have serious talent."
    new "有一家新兴妓院你一定要去看看：[brothel.name]。那里有些女孩很有本事。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2144
    old "I have it on good authority: The Princess has a lover, a man called [MC.name]. He's a deadly foreign spy who works for two or three foreign powers, at least. He's got some stupid cover story about being a brothel owner, but who can believe that?"
    new "我从可靠渠道得知：公主有个情人，名叫[MC.name]。他是个危险的外国间谍，至少为两三个外国势力效力。他编造了一个很愚蠢的借口，说自己是妓院老板，但谁会相信呢？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2145
    old "It's such a shame what happened to poor Lord Henso. To lose a child... I don't even want to think about it."
    new "可怜的亨索勋爵遭遇了这样的事，真是太可惜了。失去孩子……我都不敢想。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2146
    old "That stuck-up Knight Commander is getting on my nerves. Patrol this, patrol that- my lover's been on patrol all nights this week! When will I get any?"
    new "那个自以为是的骑士指挥官真让我心烦。巡逻这个，巡逻那个——我的爱人这周每晚都在巡逻！我什么时候才能得到片刻安宁？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2147
    old "Of course the war is going well. Do you think our mighty host has anything to fear from half-naked savages, tiny elves and talking cats?"
    new "当然，战争进展顺利。你认为我们强大的军队会惧怕半裸的野蛮人、矮小的精灵和会说话的猫吗？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2148
    old "If the Holy Land is not purged from the heretic fairies, we will all grow fur and horns, and we will start mating with donkeys and goats! So Arios speaketh!"
    new "如果圣地不清除异端仙女，我们都会长出皮毛和角，还会开始与驴和山羊交配！阿里奥斯如是说！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2154
    old "Have you heard of [MC.name], the legendary Brothel Master? I bet he can turn your sister into a sex-crazed goddess."
    new "你听说过传说中的妓院老板[MC.name]吗？我敢打赌他能把你妹妹变成一个性欲旺盛的女神。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2155
    old "[MC.name] is the best of the best. There was never a better Brothel Master in all of Zan, and there never will be."
    new "[MC.name] 是最棒的。赞恩大陆上从来没有比他更出色的妓院老板，以后也不会有。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2156
    old "Do you know about the King? I mean, the Brothel King? It's [MC.name], the legendary owner of [brothel.name]..."
    new "你知道那位国王吗？我是说，妓院之王？就是[MC.name]，传说中[brothel.name]的老板……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2157
    old "The best brothel in town? Where the hell did you come from? It's [brothel.name], of course! It's leagues ahead of every other whorehouse. The competitors just gave up."
    new "城里最好的妓院？你从哪儿冒出来的？当然是[brothel.name]！它比其他所有妓院都强太多了。竞争对手都放弃了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2163
    old "Captain Maya is really a godsend. She's going to clean up the Guard's act in no time, believe me."
    new "玛雅队长真是个天赐之才。相信我，她很快就能整顿卫队。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2164
    old "I was stopped by the guards the other day. I thought they would rob me like they usually do, but they were polite and they just let me go. Amazing."
    new "前几天我被卫兵拦住了。我以为他们会像往常一样抢劫我，但他们很有礼貌，就放我走了。真是不可思议。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2165
    old "Many of the old guards have been kicked out of the force recently. It seems like the new captain is serious about fighting corruption."
    new "近期，许多老警员都被开除了。看来新任队长是真心实意地要打击腐败。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2166
    old "Don't ever tell him I said that, but it's obvious Roz has a crush on Maya. That big oaf doesn't stand a chance..."
    new "千万别告诉他是我说的，但很明显罗兹暗恋玛雅。那个笨蛋根本没机会……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2169
    old "Is the new captain any better than the old one? Things will never change around here, no matter who's in charge."
    new "新船长比老船长好吗？不管谁当家，这里的一切都不会改变。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2170
    old "Captain Lydie seems just as shrewd as the old captain, but at least she keeps a low profile. Guild wars are bad for business."
    new "莉迪船长似乎和老船长一样精明，但至少她行事低调。公会战争对生意不利。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2176
    old "Have you seen the new guard uniforms? They adorn their armor with fine silk, while the rest of us starve..."
    new "你见过那些新卫兵的制服吗？他们用精美的丝绸装饰盔甲，而我们其他人却在挨饿……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2178
    old "The head of the guards is Captain Farah. Best stay clear of them if you want my advice. Levies and taxes are all the guards cares about. If you ask me, they just make them up as they go."
    new "卫兵首领是法拉队长。听我劝，最好离他们远点。卫兵们眼里只有征税和赋税。依我看，他们都是随随便便就收税。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2183
    old "Captain Farah is stronger than ever in the slums. She's completely unopposed now, our only choice is to pay her cronies. Do you want to hang?"
    new "法拉船长在贫民窟的势力比以往任何时候都更加强大。她现在完全没有对手，我们唯一的选择就是收买她的爪牙。你想被绞死吗？"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2184
    old "I thought things couldn't get worse with the Guard, but it did. They looted my shop and raped my wife and daughters. No one dared lift a finger..."
    new "我以为卫兵的事不会更糟了，没想到还会更糟。他们洗劫了我的店铺，强奸了我的妻子和女儿。竟然没有人敢插手……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2188
    old "Heard about the Kunoichi? A secret organization of female ninjas... That is so hot!"
    new "听说过女忍者吗？一个由女性忍者组成的秘密组织……真是太性感了！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2189
    old "I wish they'd catch those women devils, the Kunoichi. I hear they consort with demons."
    new "我真希望他们能抓住那些女魔头，那些女忍者。我听说她们和恶魔勾结。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2190
    old "Don't believe what you hear about the Kunoichi. They're pure and noble warriors."
    new "不要相信你听到的关于女忍者的谣言。她们是纯洁而高贵的战士。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2191
    old "I heard some kind of female ninja clan is going after a brothel owner in the city... Poor guy, he's dead meat."
    new "我听说城里有个女忍者组织正在追杀一个妓院老板……可怜的家伙，他死定了。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2192
    old "Female ninjas? I bet they wear very skimpy clothing... Hmm..."
    new "女忍者？我猜她们的衣服肯定很暴露……嗯……"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2193
    old "I read the tale about female ninjas that can kill using only their vagina... Crazy, I know."
    new "我读过一个关于女忍者的故事，她们可以用阴道杀人……我知道这很疯狂。"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2194
    old "When a baby gets abandoned, sometimes a ninja clan will adopt her... That's what I heard."
    new "我听说，当一个婴儿被遗弃时，有时会有忍者家族收养她……"

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2198
    old "The {b}Thieves' guild{/b} quarter is already a dump... And now there are ninjas there, too???"
    new "The {b}Thieves' guild{/b} quarter is already a dump... And now there are ninjas there, too???"

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2199
    old "Ninjas in the {b}Thieves' guild{/b} quarter... The rogues ain't gonna like that."
    new "Ninjas in the {b}Thieves' guild{/b} quarter... The rogues ain't gonna like that."

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2200
    old "I told you I saw a child in the {b}Thieves' guild{/b} quarter... I was gonna help, but then I saw she had a huge ninja star, so I thought better of it."
    new "I told you I saw a child in the {b}Thieves' guild{/b} quarter... I was gonna help, but then I saw she had a huge ninja star, so I thought better of it."

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2201
    old "She did look like a lil' brat, but she was a ninja, I tells ya! Standin' atop the {b}Thieves' guild{/b}'s roof, no less."
    new "She did look like a lil' brat, but she was a ninja, I tells ya! Standin' atop the {b}Thieves' guild{/b}'s roof, no less."

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2203
    old "I was walking alongside the {b}Beach{/b} at night, when I saw a ghost! A beautiful, pale lady ghost. And she was walking over water. Like a ninja!"
    new "I was walking alongside the {b}Beach{/b} at night, when I saw a ghost! A beautiful, pale lady ghost. And she was walking over water. Like a ninja!"

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2204
    old "I went to the {b}Beach{/b} at night to fish for trout, and I saw a beautiful lady taking a bath by the moonlight. When I tried to approach her, she disappeared like a ghost!"
    new "I went to the {b}Beach{/b} at night to fish for trout, and I saw a beautiful lady taking a bath by the moonlight. When I tried to approach her, she disappeared like a ghost!"

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2205
    old "There have been disappearances near the {b}Beach{/b}. Some blame ninjas, but that's childish nonsense."
    new "There have been disappearances near the {b}Beach{/b}. Some blame ninjas, but that's childish nonsense."

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2206
    old "So the pretty lady waved her hand, and the water around her rose and shielded her from view. We couldn't see her from the {b}Beach{/b} anymore, and none of us dared venture into the sea."
    new "So the pretty lady waved her hand, and the water around her rose and shielded her from view. We couldn't see her from the {b}Beach{/b} anymore, and none of us dared venture into the sea."

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2208
    old "I'm telling you, she was a ninja! Who else could climb the {b}Prison{/b} walls like that?"
    new "I'm telling you, she was a ninja! Who else could climb the {b}Prison{/b} walls like that?"

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2209
    old "It was the most peculiar thing, the girl snapped her fingers, and it caused a tremor! The {b}Prison{/b} guards fell down on their asses."
    new "It was the most peculiar thing, the girl snapped her fingers, and it caused a tremor! The {b}Prison{/b} guards fell down on their asses."

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2210
    old "Why would a ninja stalk the {b}Prison{/b} quarter? Any criminal knows to steer clear of our good King's jails!"
    new "Why would a ninja stalk the {b}Prison{/b} quarter? Any criminal knows to steer clear of our good King's jails!"

    # TODO game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2211
    old "Stop it, there are no such things as female ninjas flying above the {b}Prison{/b}! Now go clean up your room!"
    new "Stop it, there are no such things as female ninjas flying above the {b}Prison{/b}! Now go clean up your room!"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2218
    old "Thieves are everywhere in the slums, and guards are even worse. I can't wait to get out of this place. Other places can't possibly be this bad!"
    new "贫民窟里到处都是小偷，守卫更糟糕。我迫不及待地想离开这里。其他地方不可能这么糟糕吧！"

    # game\BKinit_variables.rpy:2219
    old "The worst thing about the slums is the stench. Or second worst thing. Worse is, you can get your throat slit for a denar and never smell a thing, ever again."
